(7653202, 1245284, 251422, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Neat:</b></div><hr/><i> Great photo, Im wondering if the background is legal? Anyway time will tell. </i></td></tr></table>Thank you. The Background is just a texture but who knows- it was fun to do and i like the shot.  The feathers actually looked like that - it''s not the texture.  I checked back on the original photo.  Thanks for your comments.</td>', 'Originally posted by Neat: Great photo, Im wondering if the background is legal? Anyway time will tell. Thank you. The Background is just a texture but who knows- it was fun to do and i like the shot.  The feathers actually looked like that - it''s not the texture.  I checked back on the original photo.  Thanks for your comments.', '2020-02-10 07:16:56.000000', NULL, 0),
