(7653204, 1245284, 251422, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by ltlmschrisss:</b></div><hr/><i> I really like this. Love the lighting and the topic choice. I am not sure about the painting texture to cover the background (rules wise). It also got a little too blended into his headdress. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Actually that is the discoloration of the feather.  The background is a texture - but I guess it will be up to the rules people. I like the shot and thanks for your comments.</td>', 'Originally posted by ltlmschrisss: I really like this. Love the lighting and the topic choice. I am not sure about the painting texture to cover the background (rules wise). It also got a little too blended into his headdress.  Actually that is the discoloration of the feather.  The background is a texture - but I guess it will be up to the rules people. I like the shot and thanks for your comments.', '2020-02-10 07:18:59.000000', NULL, 0),
